{"id":"4284b81e17c97cd2","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-skolem-function.md","title":"Skolem Function","display":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-skolem-function","aliases":["57-df-skolem-function"],"display":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-skolem-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-skolem-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolem-function — Skolem Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\">\\(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y=\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec y=\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\\)</span>；参数满足接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>，自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_\\varphi\">\\(f_\\varphi\\)</span> 是候选函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)\\)</span> 保留二元调用，结构、见证变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 及有序参数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 为固定环境参数。零元函数的输入为唯一空元组。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\nf_\\varphi:A^n\\to A\\ \\land\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\varphi)[\\vec a/\\vec y]\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\langle f_\\varphi(\\vec a)\\rangle\\frown\\vec a/\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\vec y]\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\nf_\\varphi:A^n\\to A\\ \\land\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\varphi)[\\vec a/\\vec y]\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\langle f_\\varphi(\\vec a)\\rangle\\frown\\vec a/\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\vec y]\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公式、见证变量、参数个数和结构均已固定；改变这些参数时应改变环境实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}$；参数满足接口见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]，自由变量见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}$；参数满足接口见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]，自由变量见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y=\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f_\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_\\varphi,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\nf_\\varphi:A^n\\to A\\ \\land\n\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\varphi)[\\vec a/\\vec y]\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\langle f_\\varphi(\\vec a)\\rangle\\frown\\vec a/\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\vec y]\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1375,"backlinks":[{"id":"e91afa7b7e5241b9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定函数族 $(f_j)_{j\\in J}$，每个 $f_j:A^{n_j}\\to A$ 在环境 $(\\mathfrak A,x,\\vec y_j)$ 中满足 [[57-df-skolem-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_j,\\varphi)$。固定与 $S$ 不交的单射新符号族 $(F_j)_{j\\in J}$；$n_j=0$ 时 $F_j$ 为常量，否则为 $n_j$ 元函数符号。"},{"id":"43b2728e68e05836","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-propert